{
    "title": "Battery Charging Animation App",
    "description": "<b> Charging Animation and Battery Widget </b>\r\n\r\nThe charging animation appears on your phone screen when the phone charger is connected. This charging animation comes with beautiful and cool charging effects. Make your battery widget glowing and beautiful with the charging animation app. This Charging animation is enabled when you allow it from the phone settings. Bring your battery widget to life and apply cool charging animations. \r\n\r\n<b> Features of Battery Charging Animation App </b>\r\n\r\n\u2022\tA variety of realistic and cool animations.\r\n\u2022\tVarious categories to choose from.\r\n\u2022\tNeon effect lock screen.\r\n\u2022\tOption to set an alarm or reminder when the charging is complete.\r\n\u2022\tApply amazing charging animations.\r\n\u2022\tBattery level indicator that shows how much charge has been added.\r\n\u2022\tUser-friendly interface.\r\n\r\n<b> Free Charging Animations and Charging Fun </b>\r\n\r\nCharge up with the battery charging animation. Fun, simple, and efficient. Have charging fun. Bring some charging fun into your life. Animations change every time you apply the charger. \r\n\r\n<b> Battery Charging Animation and neon effect </b>\r\n\r\nAn appealing battery charging animation is now available! Apply cool animations and make your phone look amazing while charging. Get the battery charging animation app from the play store. Add a neon effect lock screen and level up your charging game. Select an animation from the category and see whenever you charge.\r\n\r\n<b> Charger Animation \u2013 Charging Effects </b>\r\n\r\nSee a new charger animation whenever a charger is inserted. Experience stunning Charger animations that transform your phone's screen every time you connect the charger. Charger animation can be disabled later from the settings. There is a variety of charging effects, select the one you like and apply it. Make your phone look stunning with the charger animation.\r\n\r\n<b> Charging Animation App \u2013 Battery Charging Show </b>\r\n\r\nAre you looking for the cool battery animations for your phone? Want to make your charging fun? If yes, then you are in the right place! The charging animation app has all that you want. Apply to charge animations of your choice and make the battery charging show look cool.\r\n\r\n<b> Customizable Charging Animation </b>\r\n\r\nTo make your phone cool and stylish we have introduced customizable charging Animations. The Charging Animation can be enabled from phone settings to show custom charging animation. You can use customizable charging animation and set customizable screens by choosing from multiple battery charging animations.   \r\n\r\n<b> Battery Charging Animation Effect 3D </b>\r\n\r\nAll the battery charging animation effects are 3D. Apply cool effects and make your phone's screen look good while charging. Apply neon, heart, funny, circle, and many more animations on the charging screen. \r\n\r\n<b> Live Charge Animation </b>\r\n\r\nGet the live charge animation and make your phone charging screen look cool. Apply exciting animations and charge with effects. Live charge animation has made the phone charging screen extraordinary. Still, Thinking? Download the battery charging animation app from the play store and apply exciting animations.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b> Charging Animation and Battery Widget </b><br><br>The charging animation appears on your phone screen when the phone charger is connected. This charging animation comes with beautiful and cool charging effects. Make your battery widget glowing and beautiful with the charging animation app. This Charging animation is enabled when you allow it from the phone settings. Bring your battery widget to life and apply cool charging animations. <br><br><b> Features of Battery Charging Animation App </b><br><br>\u2022\tA variety of realistic and cool animations.<br>\u2022\tVarious categories to choose from.<br>\u2022\tNeon effect lock screen.<br>\u2022\tOption to set an alarm or reminder when the charging is complete.<br>\u2022\tApply amazing charging animations.<br>\u2022\tBattery level indicator that shows how much charge has been added.<br>\u2022\tUser-friendly interface.<br><br><b> Free Charging Animations and Charging Fun </b><br><br>Charge up with the battery charging animation. Fun, simple, and efficient. Have charging fun. Bring some charging fun into your life. Animations change every time you apply the charger. <br><br><b> Battery Charging Animation and neon effect </b><br><br>An appealing battery charging animation is now available! Apply cool animations and make your phone look amazing while charging. Get the battery charging animation app from the play store. Add a neon effect lock screen and level up your charging game. Select an animation from the category and see whenever you charge.<br><br><b> Charger Animation \u2013 Charging Effects </b><br><br>See a new charger animation whenever a charger is inserted. Experience stunning Charger animations that transform your phone&#39;s screen every time you connect the charger. Charger animation can be disabled later from the settings. There is a variety of charging effects, select the one you like and apply it. Make your phone look stunning with the charger animation.<br><br><b> Charging Animation App \u2013 Battery Charging Show </b><br><br>Are you looking for the cool battery animations for your phone? Want to make your charging fun? If yes, then you are in the right place! The charging animation app has all that you want. Apply to charge animations of your choice and make the battery charging show look cool.<br><br><b> Customizable Charging Animation </b><br><br>To make your phone cool and stylish we have introduced customizable charging Animations. The Charging Animation can be enabled from phone settings to show custom charging animation. You can use customizable charging animation and set customizable screens by choosing from multiple battery charging animations.   <br><br><b> Battery Charging Animation Effect 3D </b><br><br>All the battery charging animation effects are 3D. Apply cool effects and make your phone&#39;s screen look good while charging. Apply neon, heart, funny, circle, and many more animations on the charging screen. <br><br><b> Live Charge Animation </b><br><br>Get the live charge animation and make your phone charging screen look cool. Apply exciting animations and charge with effects. Live charge animation has made the phone charging screen extraordinary. Still, Thinking? Download the battery charging animation app from the play store and apply exciting animations.",
